{"qid": "Q0846", "answer": "Based on company records as of 2027-01-01, the current project staffing a colleague from Northwall Systems (where Kevin Pearce used to work) is:\n\n* **Amber — DFL mobile field-service app** (staffed by Jacob Day) [G1].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": [], "route": "graph", "route_used": "graph", "graph_rows": 1, "graph_attempted": true, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": "MATCH (kp:Entity {uid: 'Person:LS01763'})-[prev1:PREVIOUSLY_AT]->(eo:Entity {uid: 'ExternalOrg:EO-052'})<-[prev2:PREVIOUSLY_AT]-(colleague:Person), (colleague)-[w:WORKS_ON]->(pr:Project) WHERE kp <> colleague AND w.valid_to IS NULL RETURN DISTINCT colleague.name AS colleague_name, pr.name AS project_name\nLIMIT 50", "graph_linked": ["Northwall Systems", "Kevin Pearce"], "graph_facts": ["colleague_name=Jacob Day; project_name=Amber — DFL mobile field-service app"], "seconds": 74.69, "llm_calls": 4, "error": null}
