{"qid": "Q1018", "answer": "According to the leadership history in the Corporate Information Technology department charter, Prasad Kolluri became head of the department on 1 April 2020 [G1].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": [], "route": "graph", "route_used": "graph", "graph_rows": 1, "graph_attempted": true, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": "MATCH (p:Person)-[r:HEADS]->(d:Entity {uid: 'Department:IT'}) WHERE r.valid_from <= '2020-04-01' AND (r.valid_to IS NULL OR r.valid_to >= '2020-04-01') RETURN p.name AS head, p.id AS id, r.valid_from AS valid_from\nLIMIT 50", "graph_linked": ["Corporate IT", "Swiftcab Corporate Mobility", "Strategy & Corporate Development"], "graph_facts": ["head=Prasad Kolluri; id=LS00688; valid_from=2020-04-01"], "seconds": 62.12, "llm_calls": 3, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q1030", "answer": "On 30 September 2019, the domestic per diem allowance under the Travel & Expense Policy was 1000 INR [G1]. (This is a past value based on the policy version effective at that time [G1].)", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": [], "route": "graph", "route_used": "graph", "graph_rows": 1, "graph_attempted": true, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": "MATCH (p:Entity {uid: 'Policy:POL-FIN-001'})<-[:VERSION_OF]-(pv:PolicyVersion) WHERE pv.effective_from <= '2019-09-30' AND (pv.effective_to IS NULL OR pv.effective_to >= '2019-09-30') RETURN pv.key_values AS key_values\nLIMIT 50", "graph_linked": ["Travel & Expense Policy", "Monsoon Travel Desk", "Anti-Bribery & Anti-Corruption Policy"], "graph_facts": ["key_values={\"domestic_per_diem_inr\": 1000, \"intl_hotel_cap_usd\": 160, \"metro_hotel_cap_inr\": 6000}"], "seconds": 64.92, "llm_calls": 3, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q1037", "answer": "Under the Employee Stock Option Plan (Policy: POL-FIN-005), the employee stock option plan pool percentage was 8% on 31 December 2015 [G1].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": [], "route": "graph", "route_used": "graph", "graph_rows": 1, "graph_attempted": true, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": "MATCH (p:Entity {uid: 'Policy:POL-FIN-005'})<-[:VERSION_OF]-(pv:PolicyVersion) WHERE pv.effective_from <= '2015-12-31' AND (pv.effective_to IS NULL OR pv.effective_to >= '2015-12-31') RETURN pv.key_values AS key_values\nLIMIT 50", "graph_linked": ["Employee Stock Option Plan"], "graph_facts": ["key_values={\"esop_pool_pct\": 8, \"vesting\": \"4 years, 1-year cliff\"}"], "seconds": 52.92, "llm_calls": 3, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q1038", "answer": "Based on the company records for the Employee Stock Option Plan (Policy:POL-FIN-005), there are two sets of version transitions showing changes to the ESOP pool percentage:\n\n* **Transition 1 [G1]:** The ESOP pool percentage changed by **+2 percentage points** (from **8%** in version 1 to **10%** in version 2).\n* **Transition 2 [G2]:** The ESOP pool percentage changed by **+2 percentage points** (from **10%** in version 1 to **12%** in version 2).", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": [], "route": "graph", "route_used": "graph", "graph_rows": 2, "graph_attempted": true, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": "MATCH (p:Entity {uid: 'Policy:POL-FIN-005'})<-[:VERSION_OF]-(v1:PolicyVersion)<-[:SUPERSEDES]-(v2:PolicyVersion) RETURN v1.key_values AS version_1_values, v2.key_values AS version_2_values\nLIMIT 50", "graph_linked": ["Employee Stock Option Plan"], "graph_facts": ["version_1_values={\"esop_pool_pct\": 8, \"vesting\": \"4 years, 1-year cliff\"}; version_2_values={\"esop_pool_pct\": 10, \"vesting\": \"4 years, 1-year cliff\"}", "version_1_values={\"esop_pool_pct\": 10, \"vesting\": \"4 years, 1-year cliff\"}; version_2_values={\"esop_pool_pct\": 12, \"vesting\": \"4 years, 1-year cliff\"}"], "seconds": 55.77, "llm_calls": 3, "error": null}
{"qid": "Q1041", "answer": "When version 4.0 replaced version 3.0 of the Code of Conduct, the values count changed from **6 to 5** (a decrease of 1) [9]. \n\n* **Old count / values (Version 3.0):** 6 values (the pre-2021 list included \"Frugal by default\" as the sixth value alongside the current five) [2, 4].\n* **New count / values (Version 4.0):** 5 values (Customers see the light first, Own the outcome, Candour with care, Build to last, Learn out loud) [2, 4, 10].", "abstained": false, "refused": false, "clarified": false, "sources": ["LS-POL-2023-0003", "LS-HBK-2026-0001", "LS-PMR-2022-0009", "LS-MEM-2021-0012", "LS-POL-2023-0006", "LS-POL-2026-0015", "LS-RES-2023-0001", "LS-POL-2022-0008"], "route": "graph", "route_used": "vanilla", "graph_rows": 0, "graph_attempted": false, "graph_error": null, "graph_cypher": null, "graph_linked": null, "graph_facts": [], "seconds": 41.26, "llm_calls": 2, "error": null}
